flowchart TD
    A([Start Release]) --> B["Create release branch from develop<br><code>git flow release start &lt;version&gt;</code>"]
    B --> C{"Dictionary & examples
    correctly updated?"}
    C -- No --> D["Fix dictionary/example files"]
    D --> C
    C -- Yes --> E["Run update_version.py<br>Stamps .json, .dic, .yaml & example AIF"]
    E --> F["Commit version changes<br><code>git commit -m 'Prepare release &lt;version&gt;'</code>"]
    F --> G["Finish release branch<br><code>git flow release finish &lt;version&gt;</code><br>Tags & merges into master + develop"]
    G --> H["Push branches & tags<br><code>git push --all</code><br><code>git push --tags</code>"]
    H --> I["GitHub Actions triggers<br>automatic release workflow"]
    I --> J{"Release successful<br>on GitHub?"}
    J -- Yes --> K([Release Complete ✓])
    J -- No --> L["Debug & fix release issues"]
    L --> H

